            "review_text": "stefanos c\nHeraklion, Greece5 contributions\n0\nTerrible experience\nJan 2026 • Couples\nVery disappointing experience. This place feels like a complete scam. It’s far from the city center and absolutely not worth the trip. The service was terrible, even though it wasn’t busy, it took over 20 minutes just to get our coffees. The prices are high for what you get, and on top of that, they charge an extra 50k just to enter the restaurant, as the café and restaurant have separate entrance fees, which is ridiculous. Overall, a frustrating experience and definitely not recommended.\nP.S Don't trust Instagram reels!!!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 28, 2026",
